#: ../../index.rst:2
msgid "flowing-agent 文档"
msgstr "flowing-agent Documentation"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Flowing 是一个单机小型 Agent 框架，核心立场是 **「框架只提供机制，不提供策略」**——重试、压缩、审批等策略全部放在 扩展 / "
"Composable / 应用层，核心只做错误分类、钩子点与消息流转。"
msgstr ""
"Flowing is a small single-machine agent framework whose core stance is that **the framework provides mechanisms, not "
"policies** — policies such as retries, compaction, and approval all live in plugins / composables / the application "
"layer, while the core only handles error classification, hook points, and message flow."

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"本站点内容由 Sphinx ``autodoc`` 从 ``flowing/`` 包的 docstring 自动生成； docstring "
"即框架的对外契约。"
msgstr ""
"The content of this site is automatically generated by Sphinx ``autodoc`` from the docstrings of the ``flowing/`` "
"package; the docstrings are the framework's public contract."

